<title>EGYPT: Egypt exports 62,708 T cotton so far this season.</title>
<headline>Egypt exports 62,708 T cotton so far this season.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egypt exported 40 tonnes of cotton in the last two weeks, the Alexandria Cotton Exporters Association (Alcotexa) said on Monday.</p>
<p>The cumulative total for cotton export commitments this season, now in the 25th week, rose to 62,708 tonnes, added Alcotexa, which coordinates prices and exports by private and state-owned firms.</p>
<p>--Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
